  "implementation": "One inline OrdinaryDirection enum owns canonical MAP, one-FE profile, joint LSMR, fused LSMR or CMG. Engine identity derives from the LSMR variant. Independent workspace/engine/profile/CMG options and their impossible combinations are removed. First-basis optional profile/curve construction and mandatory specialized construction retain order. One replacement constructor releases stale specialized storage before allocating the committed basis. Canonical checkpoint and coexisting curve remain independent.",
