    "Mu uses canonical MAP",
    "profile allocation/nonconvergence declines; other errors remain fatal",
    "LSMR warm acceptance and curve reset; CMG permanent numerical retirement",
    "same-rank pivot replacement, active-slot precedence, heap forecasting and budget",
    "canonical refresh only when canonical ordinary direction is active"
  ],
